{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Oh, Survivor. You thought you were free?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Cam4Z</strong>, where a charming AI has\u2026 plans for you. Gather up to 4 friends and dive into a heart-pounding first-person view, battling zombie hordes. Navigate elevators to scavenge food, water, and weapons across ever-changing floors. Time\u2019s ticking\u2014linger too long, and expect some\u2026 overly friendly guests. Survive, escape, and maybe earn a shiny reward. Or not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-player co-op to prove your\u2026 questionable worth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive first-person HUD, dripping with despair.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shifting floors, endless chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie waves that make time your worst enemy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the surface\u2026 if you\u2019re that lucky.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step inside.</strong><br>The elevator\u2019s waiting. Survive, or don\u2019t. Who cares?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789160?t=1757784790","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3789160?t=1757784790","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789160/27208a96ba48e71e9f669c2f64b829e8bac5e307/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757784790","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789160/27208a96ba48e71e9f669c2f64b829e8bac5e307/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757784790","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":